CONTEXT Library IN ENGLISH
PURPOSE CONTEXT Library
{+ The library of the school. It lands on the database of the school and has no application of its own. +}

RELATION borrows[Member*Book]
REPRESENT Book TYPE ALPHANUMERIC
POPULATION Member CONTAINS [ "m1", "m2" ]
POPULATION borrows[Member*Book] CONTAINS [ ("m1", "Dik Trom") ]

ENDCONTEXT
